The design includes a cache hit ratio target (0.95 in this example) to adjust the cache size and allocation strategy dynamically. It also includes mechanisms for graceful degradation when resources are limited, as well as support for integrating an external configuration management system and machine learning model to optimize resource allocation based on network conditions and traffic patterns.

