The function can handle cases where N is zero or exceeds system limits without crashing, and it minimizes peak memory usage during bursts of activity while maintaining responsiveness. It supports a configuration parameter to include a timestamp indicating when the structures were created, and it logs the number of retries due to memory allocation failures as well as the frequency of each allocation size used during peak loads.

